    "detailed_description": "game:<br />\r\nThis is a score-impact shooting game. Players are limited to a four-sided area. Enemies outside the area are constantly attacking the player. Players gain points when they eliminate enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nAs the score increases, the difficulty also increases<br />\r\nAs the score increases, there will be more and more types of enemies.<br />\r\nThe player's highest score will be saved<br />\r\nSwitch the current weapon by touching the weapon bearer<br />\r\n<br />\r\noperate:<br />\r\nUse the letter arrow keys to control the movement of the character, point the mouse in the shooting direction, and press the left mouse button to fire the bullet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey points:<br />\r\nThere will be recoil when firing bullets, which will be a hindrance, but making good use of it can help you avoid enemy attacks.<br />\r\nFlexibly decide whether to switch weapons<br />\r\nKeep moving or you'll get attacked unexpectedly<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game borrows a lot from Bit Blaster, and due to my poor art skills, some of the special effects are imitated from Bit Blaster.",
